%N A393425 Numbers k such that sigma(k) = psi(k) + phi(k) + Omega(k)^4.
%H A393425 Max Alekseyev, <a href="/A393425/b393425.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..51</a>
%e A393425 16688 is a term since sigma(16688) = 37200 = 28800 + 7104 + 6^4 = psi(16688) + phi(16688) + Omega(16688)^4.
%o A393425 (PARI) isok(k) = {my(f = factor(k)); sigma(f) == prod(i=1, #f~, (f[i, 1]+1) * f[i, 1]^(f[i, 2]-1)) + eulerphi(f) + bigomega(f)^4;} \\ _Amiram Eldar_, Feb 14 2026
